    Summary: Strength, melee, physical. Shield Bash stuns; Rallying Cry adds Armor;
      Iron Skin breaks and blocks stuns.
  - Identity: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 699fb1eaed29cc342901941e472754b3, type: 2}
    Color: {r: 0.35, g: 0.75, b: 0.4, a: 1}
    Summary: Agility, ranged, physical. Hunter's Mark makes physical blows hurt more;
      Volley hits an area; Tumble rolls away.
  - Identity: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a09f4ce7c3778da4b956139941d9cecc, type: 2}
    Color: {r: 0.9, g: 0.4, b: 0.2, a: 1}
    Summary: Intelligence, ranged, magic. Fireball and Flame Wall stack Burning,
      which bursts at six; Combustion ignites it.
  - Identity: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 12b18f4519dbf3d4493a23e486d15ce6, type: 2}
    Color: {r: 0.6, g: 0.35, b: 0.8, a: 1}
    Summary: Agility, melee, pure. Shadow Step empowers its next cut; Eviscerate
      finishes the hurt; Smoke Veil hides it.
  - Identity: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 363c0d9ea8122fa448734025312c92d0, type: 2}
    Color: {r: 0.35, g: 0.85, b: 0.85, a: 1}
    Summary: Intelligence, ranged, magic. Drain Life channels and heals; Hex silences;
      Renewal cleanses and heals.
